  <name>Aibell</name>
  <summary>Music library and player</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Aibell is a desktop music library and player built with .NET and Avalonia. It aims for a dense, practical library view, strong browsing and local-first playback, in the spirit of Songbird and Banshee.</p>
    <p>It includes a built-in player that needs no other software, a ten-band equalizer, playlists and smart playlists, podcasts, audiobooks, internet radio, and tag and artwork editing.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.tiglate.Aibell.desktop</launchable>
  <developer id="io.github.tiglate"><name>Tiglate Pileser III</name></developer>
